cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Code and prediction artifacts for "A Weighted Soft-Voting Ensemble of CNNs for
  120-Class Plant Disease Classification on a Large-Scale Laboratory-Field Dataset"
message: >-
  If you use this code, please cite the paper given under preferred-citation. If you use
  the authors' field images, please also cite the KhetLeaf dataset,
  doi:10.5281/zenodo.22937994.
type: software
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Training and weighted soft-voting notebooks, the per-image test-set predictions of
  ResNet50, InceptionV3 and EfficientNetB0 and of their weighted ensemble, and a script
  that recomputes the accuracy, macro-averaged precision, recall and F1, multi-class MCC,
  McNemar tests and bootstrap intervals reported in the paper.
keywords:
  - plant disease classification
  - ensemble learning
  - soft voting
  - convolutional neural networks
  - reproducibility
